chapter.v:
	and you 

	 return to the Lord your God and obey His voice, according to all that I command you today, you and your children, with all your heart and with all your soul,
 [Ex. 19:18, 20; Ps. 68:8, 17; Hab. 3:3 d Deut. 2:1,]

	I call 

	 heaven and earth as witnesses today against you, that I have set before you life and death, blessing and cursing; therefore choose life, that both you and your descendants may live;
 [Ex. 15:17; Ps. 2:6; Is. 2:3 o Ps.]
